        "approval_authority": "Academic Board",
        "approval_date": "4th October 2024",
        "version": null,
        "text": "Section 2 - Purpose\n(1)\nThis Policy outlines:\nthe broad requirements for the standard nomenclature to be used for all types of La Trobe University awards;\nthe nomenclature to be used for each course level in accordance with these requirements.\n(2)\nThis Policy should be read in conjunction with:\nthe La Trobe Course Architecture;\nthe University’s\nQualifications Issuance Policy\n."
    },
    {
        "chunk_id": "155-3",
        "document_id": "155",
        "policy_title": "Award Nomenclature Policy",
        "heading_level": "h1",
