        "approval_date": "4th October 2024",
        "version": null,
        "text": "Section 3 - Scope\n(3)\nThis Policy applies to all award courses offered by La Trobe University.\n(4)\nProvisions for the certification of non-award courses are outlined in the\nShort Courses Policy\n."
    },
